            <p class="description">
              The Supply Nation Registered certification, by Supply Nation, confirms a business’s Indigenous ownership,
              management, and control. Demonstrates our commitment to Indigenous economic development, by driving
              understanding that the purchasing power of businesses can be used to deliver positive social outcomes.
